SUMMARY:Intuition Open House at Energetic Experiences
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\n**Intuition Open House: A Community Gathe
 ring for Insight and Connection**\n\nDiscover a space where the intuitive 
 community comes together to share energy\, guidance\, and meaningful exper
 iences. The Intuition Open House invites you to explore new perspectives\,
  recharge your spirit\, and connect with like-minded individuals in a rela
 xed\, welcoming environment.\n\n✨ **What Awaits You:**\nEach Saturday\, 
 intuitive practitioners gather to offer their unique gifts and services. Y
 ou'll find tarot readings\, astrology readings\, SoulCollage\, and other i
 ntuitive experiences\, there’s always something inspiring to discover. T
 he offerings vary weekly\, ensuring a fresh and exciting experience every 
 time you visit.\n\n✨ **While You’re Here:**\n\n* Relax in our cozy sea
 ting area with hot herbal tea.\n* Browse the Lightworker Library filled wi
 th inspirational resources.\n* Explore oracle cards and tune into your own
  intuition.\n\nWhether you’re seeking insight\, connection\, or a peacef
 ul moment of reflection\, the Intuition Open House is here to support you 
 on your journey.\n\n**Where:** Energetic Experiences\, just 7 minutes from
  downtown Asheville.\n**When:** Fridays & Saturdays from 12 - 4 PM\n\nCome
  as you are and see where your intuition leads. We look forward to welcomi
 ng you! ✨
